      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAY MORE WORDS (1) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 9 length third (24.19) over 407m at this track. Can go on with it. VOCIFEROUS (2) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 407m behind Weed Mat (24.69) in a Grade 6/MDN. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Better than last start and can bounce back. TOO MANY WORDS (4) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when third (24.37) at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Leading player again. ALL STRIPE (8) won as punters' elect on debut and is a major player again.",
